@guide A_Ashenvale
@name Ashenvale
@faction Alliance
@levels 19-25
@zone Ashenvale
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Maestra's Post, Astranaar, the Zoram Strand and Raene's Cleansing chain. Draenei and night elves meet here, then take the Auberdine boat to Menethil for the Wetlands.
@next A_Wetlands

turnin Onward to Ashenvale [optional] | Astranaar.
accept 970 The Tower of Althalaxx [optional] | Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post.
accept Bathran's Hair | Orendil Broadleaf, Maestra's Post.
complete Bathran's Hair | Bathran's Haven, north of Maestra's Post.
turnin Bathran's Hair
accept Orendil's Cure
complete 970 The Tower of Althalaxx [optional] | Dark Strand cultists at Ordil'Aran.
turnin 970 The Tower of Althalaxx [optional]
accept The Ancient Statuette | Talen at the Zoram Strand.
complete The Ancient Statuette | In the naga ruins on the strand.
turnin The Ancient Statuette
accept Ruuzel
fp Astranaar
bind Astranaar
accept Raene's Cleansing | Raene Wolfrunner, Astranaar.
accept Culling the Threat
accept The Zoram Strand | Shindrell Swiftfire.
accept A Helping Hand | Vindicator Palanaar (draenei, Astranaar).
turnin Orendil's Cure | Pelturas Whitemoon, Astranaar.
accept Elune's Tear
complete The Zoram Strand | Wrathtail naga at the strand.
complete Ruuzel [group=2] | Ruuzel patrols the island off the strand.
turnin Ruuzel
turnin The Zoram Strand
complete Raene's Cleansing | Teronis' corpse is at the Zoram Strand ruins.
turnin Raene's Cleansing
accept 1023 Raene's Cleansing
complete Elune's Tear | The tear lies on the isle in Lake Iris.
turnin Elune's Tear
accept The Ruins of Stardust
complete The Ruins of Stardust | Stardust Covered Bushes south of Astranaar.
turnin The Ruins of Stardust
complete Culling the Threat
turnin Culling the Threat
complete 1023 Raene's Cleansing | Gnarled ancients near the lake drop the Glowing Soul Gem.
turnin 1023 Raene's Cleansing
accept An Aggressive Defense
complete An Aggressive Defense | Foulweald furbolgs south of Astranaar.
turnin An Aggressive Defense
accept Elemental Bracers | Sentinel Velene Starstrike, Silverwind Refuge.
complete Elemental Bracers | Befouled Water Elementals at Mystral Lake; divine the bracers at the lake.
turnin Elemental Bracers
accept Mage Summoner
complete Mage Summoner | Sarilus Foulborne camps beside Mystral Lake.
turnin Mage Summoner
turnin A Helping Hand [optional]
level 24
train | Darnassus or Exodar trainers; Astranaar has some classes only.
note Fly to Auberdine and take the boat to Menethil Harbor (Wetlands).
